# Ignore everything by default (allowlist approach).
**

# Allow only essential files needed for building the container.
!src
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Filter out unwanted files from allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**.py[cod]
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
